 "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about directions to places in  a limited range of social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Wall Street "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a street in New York City where many financial buildings are located"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Many businessmen work on Wall Street."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you can hear when you work in New York City."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stock exchange"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a market where people buy and sell financial items"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The New York Stock Exchange is the largest stock market in the world."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "busy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having a lot of things to do"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Everyone looks so busy over here!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stock"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the financial value of a company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to know the stocks to work on Wall Street!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "share"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "one of the equal parts of a company's financial value"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here, people buy and sell shares of stocks in companies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to trade "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to exchange for something else"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: People trade more than 500 million shares every day!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to own"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to possess"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You own a piece of a company when you buy a share of it."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le13ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Daily Routines"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Daily routines are things you do every day.<br><br>  When you talk about daily routines, you use the Simple Present tense and a preposition of time like <span class=\"strong\">at, until, by</span> and <span class=\"strong\"> from ... to</span>.<br><br>  You use expressions of time like <span class=\"italic\">On Saturdays</span>... to say that you do things on a regular basis.<br><br>  You use adverbs and expressions of frequency to talk about daily activities like <span class=\"italic\">every day</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "People buy and sell shares of stocks in companies. They trade more than 500 million shares every day!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Prepositions of Time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverbs and Expressions of Frequency\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">at<br> until<br> by <br>from...to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">always <br> usually<br>  often <br> sometimes <br> occasionally<br>  hardly ever<br>  never<br>  every day / every week</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of a person you know (friend, family ...)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Interview the person. Ask questions about their daily routine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph (5-8 lines) about their typical day."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about the daily routine of a person I know."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about daily routines."}]}], "type": "sena"}